simulator (simulation/env.py) and symbolic shield (agents/shield.py) released
with Sentinel:

  A. Alfatemi et al., "Sentinel: A Neuro-Symbolic Co-Evolutionary Framework for
  Trustworthy Network and Service Management Against DDoS Attacks",
  IEEE Transactions on Network and Service Management, vol. 23, 2026.
  Code: https://github.com/AliAlfatemi/sentinel-ddos

